{"seq":2,"slug":"core-contributions","title":"彼得·德鲁克·core-contributions","stage":"DONE","category":"peter-drucker","categoryLabel":"彼得·德鲁克","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":4,"strategic":4.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/28_peter-drucker/2_core-contributions","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"德鲁克-核心贡献\">德鲁克·核心贡献</h1><p>彼得·德鲁克（1909–2005）对人类最根本的贡献，是把&quot;管理&quot;从依赖经验的技艺，确立为一门独立、系统、可传授的学科——他因此被称作&quot;现代管理学之父&quot;。但他本人更看重另一个身份：一位&quot;社会生态学家&quot;，毕生追问如何构建一个&quot;正常运转、维护人之自由与尊严的社会&quot;。本 hub 系统呈现这两条线索：他<strong>建立了什么学科</strong>、他<strong>提出了哪些核心理念</strong>、他的思想<strong>为何超越管理</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本-hub-与兄弟-hub-的分工\">本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</h2><p>德鲁克专题下有六个 hub，本 hub（核心贡献）回答&quot;他贡献了什么、为何重要&quot;，与其余五个分工如下，避免重复展开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>兄弟 hub</th>\n<th>回答的问题</th>\n<th>与本 hub 的边界</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><a href=\"../life-and-times/\">1_生平与时代</a></td>\n<td>他的人生经历（维也纳、逃离纳粹、通用汽车研究、晚年）</td>\n<td>本 hub 只在解释思想根源时引用，不复述生平</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>2_核心贡献（本 hub）</strong></td>\n<td>他确立的学科、核心理念、超越管理的思想</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">3_思想与方法</a></td>\n<td>具体命题与方法（企业即创造顾客、卓有成效、创新与企业家精神）</td>\n<td>本 hub 给&quot;是什么/为何重要&quot;，3 给&quot;具体怎么做&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../major-works/\">4_主要著作</a></td>\n<td>各部著作的成书与内容</td>\n<td>本 hub 引用著作作为证据，不逐书展开</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">5_影响与遗产</a></td>\n<td>对商业、亚洲、当代的实际影响</td>\n<td>本 hub 讲贡献本身，5 讲贡献的后果</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">6_争议与评价</a></td>\n<td>对其思想的批评与再评价</td>\n<td>本 hub 给正面建构，6 给批判视角</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"推荐学习路径\">推荐学习路径</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[1 现代管理学之父&lt;br/&gt;总纲: 为何是德鲁克] --&gt; B[2 管理作为一门学科&lt;br/&gt;他建了什么骨架]&#10;    B --&gt; C[3 目标管理&lt;br/&gt;核心方法]&#10;    C --&gt; D[4 知识工作者&lt;br/&gt;前瞻预见]&#10;    D --&gt; E[5 社会生态学家&lt;br/&gt;超越管理的自我定位]&#10;    E --&gt; F[6 正常运转的社会&lt;br/&gt;思想的总钥匙]\">graph LR\n    A[1 现代管理学之父&lt;br/&gt;总纲: 为何是德鲁克] --&gt; B[2 管理作为一门学科&lt;br/&gt;他建了什么骨架]\n    B --&gt; C[3 目标管理&lt;br/&gt;核心方法]\n    C --&gt; D[4 知识工作者&lt;br/&gt;前瞻预见]\n    D --&gt; E[5 社会生态学家&lt;br/&gt;超越管理的自我定位]\n    E --&gt; F[6 正常运转的社会&lt;br/&gt;思想的总钥匙]</pre><ol>\n<li><a href=\"inventing-management/the-father-of-modern-management\">现代管理学之父</a> — 全 hub 总纲，先读。</li>\n<li><a href=\"inventing-management/management-as-a-discipline\">管理作为一门学科</a> — 学科骨架（本质、三大任务、普遍适用）。</li>\n<li><a href=\"core-concepts/management-by-objectives\">目标管理</a> — 最广为采用的方法，精髓是&quot;自我控制&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"core-concepts/the-knowledge-worker\">知识工作者</a> — 最具前瞻性的预见，与目标管理同源。</li>\n<li><a href=\"beyond-management/a-social-ecologist\">社会生态学家</a> — 理解他人文底色的钥匙。</li>\n<li><a href=\"beyond-management/the-functioning-society\">正常运转的社会</a> — 全部思想的出发点与归宿。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"前置与延伸\">前置与延伸</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>前置</strong>：无需管理学背景；若想了解他思想的传记根源（维也纳、反极权），可先浏览 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>。</li>\n<li><strong>读完之后</strong>：想看具体方法，转 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>；想看实际影响，转 <a href=\"../influence-and-legacy/\">影响与遗产</a>；想看批评视角，转 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"inventing-management","title":"Inventing Management","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/inventing-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-father-of-modern-management","title":"现代管理学之父","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/inventing-management/the-father-of-modern-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"management-as-a-discipline","title":"管理作为一门学科","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/inventing-management/management-as-a-discipline"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"core-concepts","title":"Core Concepts","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/core-concepts","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"management-by-objectives","title":"目标管理","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/core-concepts/management-by-objectives"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-knowledge-worker","title":"知识工作者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/core-concepts/the-knowledge-worker"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"beyond-management","title":"Beyond Management","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/beyond-management","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"a-social-ecologist","title":"社会生态学家","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/beyond-management/a-social-ecologist"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-functioning-society","title":"正常运转的社会","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/peter-drucker/core-contributions/beyond-management/the-functioning-society"}]}]}